{
  "slug": "supermetrics",
  "name": "Supermetrics",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Battle-tested marketing analytics workflows for six personas — performance marketers, marketing leaders, demand gen, content, field, and eCommerce — built on top of the Supermetrics connector. 42 workflows total, with helper scripts, deliverable templates, and a consistent visualization framework.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `content-marketer` (Battle-tested workflows for content marketing managers diagnosing landing page performance and analyzing paid promotion of content assets via…), `demand-gen` (Battle-tested workflows for B2B demand generation managers connecting ad platform spend to website behavior and pipeline outcomes via…), `ecommerce-marketer` (Battle-tested workflows for ecommerce marketers running paid acquisition campaigns where direct revenue attribution is the whole point —…), `field-marketer` (Battle-tested workflows for field marketing managers running localized events and campaigns on tight timelines via the Supermetrics connector), `marketing-leader` (Battle-tested workflows for marketing analytics and leadership work — quarterly executive overviews, multi-channel budget pacing and forecasting, and…), `performance-marketer` (Battle-tested workflows for performance marketers running paid campaigns on Google Ads, Facebook Ads, LinkedIn Ads, TikTok Ads, and…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install supermetrics@claude-community` from `supermetrics-public/claude-marketing-plugin` (`plugins/supermetrics-marketing`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
